<!--
  wp81_weather_showers - violent showers.

  The same rain, four drops of it and every one longer: rain hard enough to be its
  own kind of weather, which is the one WMO code this shell words as a storm.
  Drawn on the same 76x76 grid and at the same 3-4 unit weight as the rest of the WP8.1
  glyph set, and emitted white so the tile tints it to its accent.
-->
